### 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jaehoon"
}

### 없는 이름으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hana"
}

### 나는 누구
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### 쿠키를 고쳐서 보내면
# @no-cookie-jar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Cookie: userId=1

### 헤더로 보내면
# @no-cookie-jar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer 1

### 쿠키를 고쳐서 보내면
# @no-cookie-jar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Cookie: sessionId=1

### 로그아웃
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout